                    "source_name": "iSIGHT Sandworm 2014", "description": "In the Ukraine 2015 incident, [Sandworm Team](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0034) sent spearphishing attachments to three energy distribution companies containing malware to gain access to victim systems. (Citation: UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT WESTERN DISTRICT OF PENNSYLVANIA October 2020)",
