few_shot_answers:
Filtering network traffic is used to block or allow specific network messages based on their application layer (OSI Layer 7) protocol, especially for automation protocols. This technique can help secure industrial control systems (ICS) from attacks that use unauthorized command messages.
        }
    ]
}

context: In recent years, there has been an increase in ICS-targeted attacks leveraging unauthorized command messages.
